      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "UNSTABLE MABLE (8) goes very well this course and distance starting 11 times for five wins and four minors. In the money last time at this track (19.67) in a Free For All, finishing a 0.8 lengths second. Looks the one to beat with even luck. SOLICIT (2) was strong over this course and distance last time despite filling the minors, finishing one length behind Summer's Scrub in 19.70 and recording a new PB here. Will be in this for a long way. HERBIE SURE CAN (1) produced a modest effort most recently when seventh at this track over 352m behind Perky Penny (20.24) in a Free For All. Was in the money the start prior. Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. One of the better chances. LADY DREAMER (3) is always hard to beat when she races here at this trip.",
